All 15 tests pass. Fixes applied across three modules:

- **auth.py**: `has_permission` now does case-insensitive comparison; `is_admin_or_owner` uses `or` instead of `and`.
- **inventory.py**: Replaced mutable default `{}` with `None` + `dict(initial)`; `add` now accumulates (`+=`) instead of overwriting; `reserve` uses `>` instead of `>=` so exact-qty reservations succeed; `release` raises `ValueError` when releasing more than reserved.
